            <ArticleTitle>Prostacyclin in the treatment of painful Peyronie's disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>516-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The effect of a prostacyclin infusion was studied in 5 men with persistent pain associated with Peyronie's disease. Marked side effects were associated with the infusion, which was of limited benefit.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
